ing the number of tickets opened.\n\n**Recommendation**:\n- Evaluate team capacity and consider redistributing tasks to balance workload.\n- Explore automation tools to reduce manual effort and improve efficiency.\n\n### General Process Efficiency Recommendations\n- **Triage and Prioritization**: Implement a more robust triage system to ensure high-priority issues are addressed promptly.\n- **Retrospectives**: Conduct regular sprint retrospectives to identify and address process inefficiencies.\n- **Resource Allocation**: Consider temporary resource adjustments to handle backlog and high-priority issues.\n- **Training and Development**: Provide training to enhance team skills, particularly in areas causing bottlenecks."
